#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Dynadot.php
msgid "Manages domains on Dynadot through API3. Add this server's IP address to the API allow list in Dynadot (Tools > API) and keep enough account balance for registrations and renewals."
msgstr "Domenlarni Dynadot'da API3 orqali boshqaradi. Ushbu serverning IP manzilini Dynadot'dagi API ruxsat ro'yxatiga qo'shing (Tools > API) va ro'yxatdan o'tkazish hamda yangilash uchun hisobda yetarli qoldiq saqlang."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Enom.php
msgid "Manages domains on Enom through its reseller API. Allow this server's IP address in the Enom API settings and keep enough account funds for registrations and renewals. Enom auto-renewal is off for every domain: ClientFence renews a domain when its renewal invoice is paid. With test mode on, enter the reseller ID and API token of your Enom test account (resellertest.enom.com)."
msgstr "Domenlarni Enom'da uning dilerlar API'si orqali boshqaradi. Ushbu serverning IP manziliga Enom API sozlamalarida ruxsat bering va ro'yxatdan o'tkazish hamda yangilash uchun hisobda yetarli mablag' saqlang. Enom avtomatik yangilanishi har bir domen uchun o'chirilgan: ClientFence domenni yangilash hisob-fakturasi to'langanda yangilaydi. Sinov rejimi yoqilganda Enom sinov hisobingizning diler ID'si va API tokenini kiriting (resellertest.enom.com)."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Inwx.php
msgid "Manages domains on INWX through its DomRobot API. Use an INWX account (or sub-account) without two-factor sign-in, and keep enough account funds for registrations and renewals. Domains are registered to expire unless ClientFence renews them, which it does when the renewal invoice is paid. With test mode on, enter the username and password of your INWX OT&E test account."
msgstr "Domenlarni INWX'da DomRobot API orqali boshqaradi. Ikki bosqichli kirishsiz INWX hisobidan (yoki quyi hisobdan) foydalaning va ro'yxatdan o'tkazish hamda yangilash uchun hisobda yetarli mablag' saqlang. Domenlar muddati tugashi uchun ro'yxatdan o'tkaziladi, agar ClientFence ularni yangilamasa; u buni yangilash hisob-fakturasi to'langanda qiladi. Sinov rejimi yoqilganda INWX OT&E sinov hisobingizning foydalanuvchi nomi va parolini kiriting."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Internetbs.php
msgid "Manages domains on Internetbs via API"
msgstr "Domenlarni Internetbs'da API orqali boshqaradi"

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Namesilo.php
msgid "Manages domains on NameSilo through its API. Create the API key in NameSilo (Account > API Manager), allow this server's IP address there, and keep enough account funds for registrations and renewals. In the API Manager, also turn off restorations by renewDomain: ClientFence refuses to renew a domain in its restore period, but NameSilo would otherwise restore it at the restoration fee."
msgstr "Domenlarni NameSilo'da uning API'si orqali boshqaradi. NameSilo'da API kalitini yarating (Account > API Manager), u yerda ushbu serverning IP manziliga ruxsat bering va ro'yxatdan o'tkazish hamda yangilash uchun hisobda yetarli mablag' saqlang. API Manager'da renewDomain orqali tiklashni ham o'chiring: ClientFence tiklash davridagi domenni yangilashni rad etadi, aks holda NameSilo uni tiklash to'lovi evaziga tiklagan bo'lardi."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Namecheap.php
msgid "Manages domains on Namecheap via API. Namecheap requires your server IP in order to work."
msgstr "Domenlarni Namecheap'da API orqali boshqaradi. Namecheap ishlashi uchun serveringiz IP'si kerak."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Netearthone.php
msgid "Manages domains on NetEarthOne via API. NetEarthOne requires your server IP in order to work. Login to the NetEarthOne control panel (the url will be in the email you received when you signed up with them) and then go to Settings > API and enter the IP address of the server where ClientFence is installed to authorize it for API access."
msgstr "Domenlarni NetEarthOne'da API orqali boshqaradi. NetEarthOne ishlashi uchun serveringiz IP'si kerak. NetEarthOne boshqaruv paneliga kiring (URL ro'yxatdan o'tganingizda olgan xatingizda), Settings > API'ga o'ting va API'ga kirishga ruxsat berish uchun ClientFence o'rnatilgan serverning IP manzilini kiriting."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Openprovider.php
msgid "Manages domains on Openprovider through its API. Use an Openprovider API user, allow this server's IP address for it, and keep enough account funds for registrations and renewals. Openprovider auto-renewal is turned off for every domain: ClientFence renews a domain when its renewal invoice is paid. With test mode on, enter the username and password of your Openprovider sandbox account."
msgstr "Domenlarni Openprovider'da API orqali boshqaradi. Openprovider API foydalanuvchisidan foydalaning, uning uchun ushbu serverning IP manziliga ruxsat bering va ro'yxatdan o'tkazish hamda yangilash uchun hisobda yetarli mablag' saqlang. Openprovider avtomatik yangilanishi har bir domen uchun o'chirilgan: ClientFence domenni yangilash hisob-fakturasi to'langanda yangilaydi. Sinov rejimi yoqilganda Openprovider sandbox hisobingizning foydalanuvchi nomi va parolini kiriting."

#: src/library/Registrar/Adapter/Resellbiz.php
msgid "Manages domains on Resell.biz via API. Resell.biz requires your server IP in order to work. Login to the Resell.biz control panel (the url will be in the email you received when you signed up with them) and then go to Settings > API and enter the IP address of the server where ClientFence is installed to authorize it for API access."
msgstr "Domenlarni Resell.biz'da API orqali boshqaradi. Resell.biz ishlashi uchun serveringiz IP'si kerak. Resell.biz boshqaruv paneliga kiring (URL ro'yxatdan o'tganingizda olgan xatingizda), Settings > API'ga o'ting va API'ga kirishga ruxsat berish uchun ClientFence o'rnatilgan serverning IP manzilini kiriting."

