#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Connected to Upmind."
msgstr "Upmind'ga ulandi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Upmind/Snapshot.php
msgid "Could not make the folder :dir."
msgstr ":dir jildini yaratib bo'lmadi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Currencies, countries and gateways"
msgstr "Valyutalar, mamlakatlar va shlyuzlar"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Domain transfer prices, exchange rates and billing periods other than 1, 3, 6, 12, 24 or 36 months: the warnings name them."
msgstr "Domen ko'chirish narxlari, valyuta kurslari va 1, 3, 6, 12, 24 yoki 36 oydan boshqa hisob-kitob davrlari: ogohlantirishlar ularni ko'rsatadi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/Whmcs/Import.php
msgid "Enter the Upmind API token."
msgstr "Upmind API tokenini kiriting."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Go on reading Upmind"
msgstr "Upmind'ni o'qishni davom ettirish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Import from Upmind"
msgstr "Upmind'dan import qilish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "In Upmind, open Settings > API Tokens > Create API Token. Allow it to view clients, products, contracts, invoices, payments and tickets, and add this server's IP address to its IP whitelist."
msgstr "Upmind'da Settings > API Tokens > Create API Token bo'limini oching. Unga mijozlar, mahsulotlar, shartnomalar, hisob-fakturalar, to'lovlar va chiptalarni ko'rishga ruxsat bering va bu serverning IP manzilini uning IP oq ro'yxatiga qo'shing."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Invoices with a zero total (Upmind makes one for each service it imported) and credit top-ups: the client's credit balance carries them."
msgstr "Jami summasi nol bo'lgan hisob-fakturalar (Upmind import qilingan har bir xizmat uchun bittadan yaratadi) va balansni to'ldirishlar: ularni mijozning kredit balansi qoplaydi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Moving from Upmind instead of WHMCS? Upmind is hosted, so the import reads it through its API: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in Upmind. Where the steps below say WHMCS, they mean what was read from Upmind."
msgstr "WHMCS o'rniga Upmind'dan o'tyapsizmi? Upmind hosting qilingan xizmat, shuning uchun import uni API orqali o'qiydi: kerakli ma'lumotni shu serverdagi shaxsiy faylga nusxalaydi, so'ng bu faylni quyidagi qadamlar bilan import qiladi. Upmind'da hech narsa o'zgarmaydi. Quyidagi qadamlarda WHMCS deyilgan joyda Upmind'dan o'qilgan ma'lumot nazarda tutiladi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Passwords: clients set a new one with \"Forgot password\"."
msgstr "Parollar: mijozlar \"Parolni unutdingizmi\" orqali yangisini o'rnatadi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Products and domain prices"
msgstr "Mahsulotlar va domen narxlari"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Read"
msgstr "O'qildi"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Read Upmind"
msgstr "Upmind'ni o'qish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Read Upmind again"
msgstr "Upmind'ni qayta o'qish"

