msgid "WHMCS and Upmind import"
msgstr "WHMCS va Upmind importi"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "What Upmind does not give, so it is not imported"
msgstr "Upmind bermaydigan va shu sababli import qilinmaydigan narsalar"

# To translate (tools/locales.py starter).
#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Fixed and regional taxes, other tax rates for companies, domain transfer prices, exchange rates and billing periods other than 1, 3, 6, 12, 24 or 36 months: the warnings name them. Tax rates by country come over with tax switched off."
msgstr "Qat'iy va hududiy soliqlar, kompaniyalar uchun boshqa soliq stavkalari, domen ko'chirish narxlari, valyuta kurslari va 1, 3, 6, 12, 24 yoki 36 oydan boshqa hisob-kitob davrlari: ogohlantirishlar ularni ko'rsatadi. Mamlakatlar bo'yicha soliq stavkalari import qilinadi, lekin soliqning o'zi o'chirilgan holda qoladi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "In Upmind, open Settings > API Tokens > Create API Token. Allow it to view clients, products, contracts, invoices, payments, tickets and taxes, and add this server's IP address to its IP whitelist."
msgstr "Upmind'da Settings > API Tokens > Create API Token bo'limini oching. Unga mijozlar, mahsulotlar, shartnomalar, hisob-fakturalar, to'lovlar, chiptalar va soliqlarni ko'rishga ruxsat bering va bu serverning IP manzilini uning IP oq ro'yxatiga qo'shing."

# To translate (tools/locales.py starter).
#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Check against :source"
msgstr ":source bilan solishtirish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Choose the system you are moving from and save its details. ClientFence only reads it: nothing changes there, and nothing is emailed or charged. The plan and the import below use the system saved last: :source."
msgstr "Ko'chib o'tayotgan tizimni tanlang va uning ma'lumotlarini saqlang. ClientFence uni faqat o'qiydi: u yerda hech narsa o'zgarmaydi, hech narsa elektron pochta orqali yuborilmaydi va pul yechilmaydi. Quyidagi reja va import oxirgi saqlangan tizimdan foydalanadi: :source."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Import from :source into this install now? Keep this page open until it finishes."
msgstr ":source dan ushbu o'rnatishga hozir import qilinsinmi? Tugaguncha bu sahifani ochiq tuting."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "In :source"
msgstr ":source da"

#: src/modules/System/templates/admin/mod_system_settings.html.twig
msgid "Migration"
msgstr "Migratsiya"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Move from"
msgstr "Qayerdan ko'chirish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Move from another billing system"
msgstr "Boshqa hisob-kitob tizimidan ko'chirish"

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "No plan yet. Make one to see what :source holds."
msgstr "Reja hali yo'q. :source da nima borligini ko'rish uchun reja tuzing."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The import has started from :source, so the system cannot change."
msgstr ":source dan import boshlandi, shuning uchun tizimni o'zgartirib bo'lmaydi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "This install already has data (%counts%). The import keeps the ids and invoice numbers of :source, so it needs a fresh install."
msgstr "Bu o'rnatishda allaqachon ma'lumotlar bor (%counts%). Import :source identifikatorlari va hisob-faktura raqamlarini saqlaydi, shuning uchun yangi o'rnatish kerak."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "Upmind is hosted, so the import reads it through its API: it copies what it needs into a private file on this server, then imports that file with the steps below. Nothing changes in Upmind."
msgstr "Upmind xostingda ishlaydigan xizmat, shuning uchun import uni API orqali o'qiydi: kerakli narsani shu serverdagi shaxsiy faylga nusxalaydi, so'ng bu faylni quyidagi bosqichlar bilan import qiladi. Upmind da hech narsa o'zgarmaydi."

#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "What :source holds and what the import does with it. Making the plan changes nothing in :source. For very large installs, the console runs the same steps: php console.php clientfence:whmcs-import plan"
msgstr ":source da nima bor va import u bilan nima qiladi. Rejani tuzish :source da hech narsani o'zgartirmaydi. Juda katta o'rnatishlar uchun konsol xuddi shu bosqichlarni bajaradi: php console.php clientfence:whmcs-import plan"

# To translate (tools/locales.py starter).
#: src/modules/Clientfence/templates/admin/mod_clientfence_whmcs_panel.html.twig
msgid "The plan below was made from :old. Saving these details moves the import to :new and deletes that plan; you then make a new one. Go on?"
msgstr "Quyidagi reja :old dan tuzilgan. Bu ma'lumotlarni saqlash importni :new ga o'tkazadi va o'sha rejani o'chiradi; keyin yangisini tuzasiz. Davom etilsinmi?"
